## Run it

```bash
make serve
curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8080/healthz
curl -s -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"title":"first"}' \
  http://127.0.0.1:8080/notes.v1.NoteService/CreateNote
```

One port serves gRPC, gRPC-Web and the Connect protocol (JSON over plain HTTP).
The server logs JSON to stdout and stops cleanly on Ctrl+C or SIGTERM.

