## Configuration

Settings come from environment variables only. See [docs/configuration.md](docs/configuration.md).

| Variable | Default | Meaning |
|---|---|---|
| `HOST` | `127.0.0.1` | Address to listen on (`0.0.0.0` in a container) |
| `PORT` | `8080` | Port to listen on (`0` picks a free one) |
| `LOG_LEVEL` | `info` | `debug`, `info`, `warn` or `error` |
| `SHUTDOWN_TIMEOUT` | `10s` | How long in-flight calls get after a stop signal |
| `DRAIN_DELAY` | `0s` | How long health checks report NOT_SERVING before the port closes |
| `REFLECTION` | `true` | Serve gRPC server reflection |

## Development

Requires Go, make, a C compiler (for the race detector) and [golangci-lint](https://golangci-lint.run/). buf and the protoc plugins run through `go tool`.

| Command | What it does |
|---|---|
| `make generate` | Regenerate `gen/` from `proto/` |
| `make buf-lint` | Lint and format-check the `.proto` files |
| `make breaking` | Check `proto/` for wire-breaking changes against `main` |
| `make build` | Build `bin/server` |
| `make serve` | Build and run the server in the foreground |
| `make test` | Unit and loopback RPC tests with the race detector |
| `make test-integration` | Run the built binary and call it over gRPC and Connect |
| `make lint` | golangci-lint |
| `make ci` | Everything CI runs |

See [docs/DEVELOPMENT.md](docs/DEVELOPMENT.md) and [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](docs/ARCHITECTURE.md).

